{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 165317, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 111153, "uid": 56174, "type": 4, "title": "木队星云wb", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1660890910, "updated_at": 1661099715, "updated_uid": 176744, "comment_at": 1674760378, "last_at": 1674982422, "comment_count": 10, "status": 1, "summary": "这次给大家带来一套以木队为主体的队伍，目前可过二星乳贴，一星狐狸，一星亚里亚。阵容概要阵容细节1.首先是攻击力相关。因为刀天然攻击力属性就高所以木系角色不是很需要调整。理论上单刀佩皮塔一只是可以通关的", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_718/1164/176744/2022/7/21/182730.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1016/1164/176744/2022/7/21/771220.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1022/1164/176744/2022/7/21/538522.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 4, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 6619, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 3, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 165317, "content": "这次给大家带来一套以木队为主体的队伍，目前可过二星乳贴，一星狐狸，一星亚里亚。<div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">阵容概要</span></div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"718\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_718/1164/176744/2022/7/21/182730.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_718/1164/176744/2022/7/21/182730.png\"></div></div><div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">阵容细节</span></div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">首先是攻击力相关。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 因为刀天然攻击力属性就高所以木系角色不是很需要调整。理论上单刀佩皮塔一只是可以通关的，但是单刀就要最好让佩皮塔，木伞和木人鱼前三，其次是光属性的攻击力调整，光琴和茶杯要在前三。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">重点是让光琴和茶杯吃到加速</span>可以多次打n解冷却和充能。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;攻击力的调整方法因为星云不看装备和魂卡，所以可以靠温泉和石头的白色属性选择来调整。鉴于石头的稀少，更推荐温泉。</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">2.</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">为什么不带弱伤加成？</span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 因为是跨属性打boss，所以通用的弱点增伤全都无效。木人鱼这里的主要作用也是延长debuff时间和减少减益回避。</span></span></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">3.<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">甜甜圈队长呢，我无敌的甜甜圈呢？</span></span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 经过本人实测，甜甜圈队长技的增伤不如佩皮塔队长。（亚里亚的防御力经tere测试为2000，木伞一人可以清空--咸鱼老四）</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;但是甜甜圈的n在打火狐狸的时候可以偷走对面的反射等buff，效果非凡。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">4.</span>我抄完后，翻车了。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;这个阵容是有概率会减员的，但是星云wb你中途退出是不会消耗票的所以可以放心重开。如果多次减员那就再上一个木奶。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">技能设置</span></div></div></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"1016\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1016/1164/176744/2022/7/21/771220.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1016/1164/176744/2022/7/21/771220.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"1022\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1022/1164/176744/2022/7/21/538522.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1022/1164/176744/2022/7/21/538522.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"1040\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1040/1164/176744/2022/7/21/191585.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1040/1164/176744/2022/7/21/191585.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"1021\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1021/1164/176744/2022/7/21/747624.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1021/1164/176744/2022/7/21/747624.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span>&nbsp; &nbsp;ds设置在阵容概要里展示的有。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">（个人认为光琴和茶杯头可以打一下s来加速，鲁邦可以大胆点满n。另外本来佩皮塔也不考ft，泉佬觉最后一个ds可以给奶缓解压力----咸鱼老四）</div><br></span></span></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">阵容改动</span></div></div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"718\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_718/1164/176744/2022/7/21/874529.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_718/1164/176744/2022/7/21/874529.png\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 红圈/黄圈成员可根据自身情况自定义交换白兔子</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">、暗乳贴</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">、</span><span style=\"\">火人鱼等<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">（</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">火人鱼+特蕾莎</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">组合要求火人鱼是攻击力最高）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">。我这套阵容佩皮塔单下ss伤害最高可以120万+（55级好感度）带双刀是因为佩皮塔单人伤害好像不太够。</span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">伤害详情</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2160\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2160/1164/176744/2022/7/21/796525.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2160/1164/176744/2022/7/21/796525.jpg\"></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; 1星亚里亚，尤娜的伤害占比也不低。</span></span></div><div><br></div></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">道中阵容</span></span></div></div><br></div><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div>最后道中队伍本人道中队伍：</div><div>1、正常PVP火队（火盾替换成木伞、甜甜圈、火伊芙），最大敌人是毒奶（很看运气+好友队长）</div><div>2、对抗百分比奶（暗毒奶+火奶劳菲+火盾+火人鱼+<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">乳贴/牡丹），只能打毒奶且看运气</span></div><div>3、对抗水属or输出较低的阵容（佩皮塔+木猫+木狂暴+暴击+<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">火奶劳菲</span>）</div><div><br></div></span><div><br></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_718/1164/176744/2022/7/21/182730.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1016/1164/176744/2022/7/21/771220.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_1022/1164/176744/2022/7/21/538522.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 56174, "username": "Garlic", "avatar": "http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/MUkH0f0C7PmJ5glcFKzIDwErk8GJkr3USX19ib1tDzuKebvztLfB4vXOmiaQV5SYlibHhktCj6HDqXnfX4c2TtU5Q/132", "description": "", "follow_num": 13, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 97981014, "content_num": 421, "read_num": 880520, "like_num": 164}, "update_user": {"uid": 176744, "username": "咸鱼老四", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/22.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 1, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 56174, "username": "Garlic", "avatar": "http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/MUkH0f0C7PmJ5glcFKzIDwErk8GJkr3USX19ib1tDzuKebvztLfB4vXOmiaQV5SYlibHhktCj6HDqXnfX4c2TtU5Q/132", "last_ip_ar